      "body": "<div><div>\r\n<style>\r\n#fae_osrsoht p.fab6k8g, #fae_osrsoht li.fab6k8g, #fae_osrsoht :where(.front-email-body) div.fab6k8g\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tfont-size:11.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n\tmso-ligatures:standardcontextual;}\r\n#fae_osrsoht a:link, #fae_osrsoht span.farytb2y\r\n\t{mso-style-priority:99;\r\n\tcolor:#0563C1;\r\n\ttext-decoration:underline;}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{size:8.5in 11.0in;\r\n\tmargin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;}\r\n#fae_osrsoht :where(.front-email-body) div.fac9qm84\r\n\t{page:WordSection1;}\r</style></div><div lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\" class=\"fa0 front-email-body\"><div class=\"fac9qm84\"><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><b><u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NEW REFERRAL&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span></span></u></b></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">To:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Precise Imaging Scheduling Team<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Our client:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Adrian Alcala<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">DOB:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 03/06/1974<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Address:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;1424 Monitor Ave Suisun City CA 94585<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Phone#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(650) 861-2525<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Email:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:Alcalafamily3@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alcalafamily3@gmail.com</a><span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Message:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; We would like to refer our client to your office for an MRI. Please find the referral attached and please send me the link to sign your lien.<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Thank You!<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Very truly yours,<span style=\"mso-ligatures:none\"><span></span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><b><span style=\"font-size:24.0pt;font-family:&quot;Edwardian Script ITC&quot;\">Jacqueline Smith<span></span></span></b></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Paralegal<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Tel:&nbsp; (415) 223-6201 <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Handwriting&quot;\"><span></span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Fax:&nbsp; (415) 723-7792<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">Text: (415) 472-9925<span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\">E-mail: <u><span style=\"color:#0563C1\"><a href=\"mailto:Jsmith@18004injury.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Jsmith@18004injury.com</span></a><span></span></span></u></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"291\" height=\"97\" style=\"width:3.0333in;height:1.0083in\" id=\"Picture_x0020_3\" src=\"/us-west-1/api/1/companies/88d6512b91118f61d8bf/attachments/c0a56b432121a2ac5285e6a041dea2a661bcbc2e?resource_link_id=84031036673\" front-cid=\"image001.png@01DB9D9C.707BEB70\" /><span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Privileged and Confidential -- This electronic message contains information from Kuvara Law Firm which may be confidential or protected by the attorney-client privilege and/or the work product doctrine and is intended solely for the use of the addressee listed above. If you are neither the intended recipient nor the employee or agent responsible for delivering this electronic message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any disclosure, copying, distribution or the use of the content of this electronic message is strictly prohibited. If you have received this electronic message in error, please immediately notify us by replying to this message and delete the original message.</span><span></span></p><p class=\"fab6k8g\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div>",
      "text": "\nNEW REFERRAL \n\n\nTo: Precise Imaging Scheduling Team\n\n\nOur client: Adrian Alcala\n\n\nDOB: 03/06/1974\n\n\nAddress: 1424 Monitor Ave Suisun City CA 94585\n\n\nPhone# (650) 861-2525\n\n\nEmail: Alcalafamily3@gmail.com\n\n\nMessage: We would like to refer our client to your office for an MRI. Please find the referral attached and please send me the link to sign your lien.\n\n\nThank You!\n\n\n\nVery truly yours,\n\n\nJacqueline Smith\n\nParalegal\n\nTel: (415) 223-6201 \n\nFax: (415) 723-7792\n\nText: (415) 472-9925\n\nE-mail: Jsmith@18004injury.com\n\n\nPrivileged and Confidential -- This electronic message contains information from Kuvara Law Firm which may be confidential or protected by the attorney-client privilege and/or the work product doctrine and is intended solely for the use of the addressee listed above. If you are neither the intended recipient nor the employee or agent responsible for delivering this electronic message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any disclosure, copying, distribution or the use of the content of this electronic message is strictly prohibited. If you have received this electronic message in error, please immediately notify us by replying to this message and delete the original message.",
